      "content": "it’s just that everything is so stagnant. i spend all my time prepared for the end, and it makes me realize how much of a waste the \"middle\" part is. like, why am i fighting so hard to stay present in a world that’s just waiting to become empty? it feels more like a chore than a life at this point.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
